{#-
  BLOCK: gallery — §06's `gallery`. A listing card, in the three sizes the
  layouts use.

  One block with a `size` rather than three files, because the three differ only
  in dimensions and which optional lines they show: `large` carries location and
  specs, `compact` carries city and specs at smaller type, `plain` is the
  market-snapshot card with address and price alone. Three files would make that
  relationship invisible and would be three places to fix the next photo bug.

  B5 IS WHY THE MISSING-PHOTO BRANCH IS A DIV AND NOT AN `<img>` WITH NO SRC. The
  register records a broken-image glyph with the alt text beside it on one
  surface and a blank grey box on another — the same absent photo rendering two
  different ways. It is a grey block here, on every size, and the register's
  preferred fix (a hatched fill with a camera glyph and "Photo pending") is still
  open: this move preserves current behaviour rather than improving it, because
  the consolidation is a restructure.

  Values arrive formatted. `price`, `specs` and `location` are assembled in
  `_gallery_card_context()`, where the "N/A" fallbacks and the bullet joining are
  testable.
-#}
{% if size == 'plain' -%}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
                        <tr><td>{{ photo_html }}</td></tr>
                        <tr><td style="padding: 8px 0 0;">
                          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #333333;">{{ address }}</p>
                          <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: {{ ink }};">{{ price }}</p>
                        </td></tr>
                      </table>
{%- elif size == 'large' -%}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff;">
                        <tr><td>{{ photo_html }}</td></tr>
                        <tr><td style="padding: 14px;">
                          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">{{ address }}</p>
                          {% if location %}<p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">{{ location }}</p>{% endif %}
                          <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: {{ ink }};">{{ price }}</p>
                          {% if specs %}<p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">{{ specs }}</p>{% endif %}
                        </td></tr>
                      </table>
{%- else -%}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff;">
                        <tr><td>{{ photo_html }}</td></tr>
                        <tr><td style="padding: 12px;">
                          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">{{ address }}</p>
                          {% if location %}<p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;">{{ location }}</p>{% endif %}
                          <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: {{ ink }};">{{ price }}</p>
                          {% if specs %}<p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;">{{ specs }}</p>{% endif %}
                        </td></tr>
                      </table>
{%- endif %}
